Reason from first principles here. Which index pair does this scan return?
int[] a = {4, 7, 9, 11, 13, 15};
int i = 0, j = a.length - 1;
while (i < j) { int s = a[i] + a[j]; if (s == 11) return new int[]{i, j}; if (s < 11) i++; else j--; }
return new int[]{-1, -1};

